abstract: >-
  A speculative concept study exploring distributed swarms of autonomous ultralight atmospheric microdevices for Martian CO2 processing using compact plasma-vortex reactors. The manuscript distinguishes demonstrated evidence, literature-supported mechanisms, engineering extrapolation, and long-horizon speculation, and frames the architecture as a falsifiable research hypothesis rather than a validated mission design.
